{"qid": "Q0008", "answer": "Based on version 2.0 of the Business Continuity Policy (POL-OPS-002), the business continuity plan (BCP) test is conducted **annually** (updated from the previous annual frequency with the addition of a pandemic annex) [9].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2020-0002", "LS-POL-2024-0002", "LS-POL-2019-0001", "LS-POL-2020-0001", "LS-POL-2019-0005", "LS-POL-2020-0005", "LS-POL-2022-0006", "LS-POL-2020-0003"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 11.22, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0011", "answer": "In version 2.0 of the Incident Response Policy (effective 1 April 2021), a SEV1 incident shall be acknowledged within 15 minutes of the first alert or report [3, 9, 10].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2021-0010", "LS-POL-2022-0017", "LS-POL-2024-0012", "LS-POL-2017-0004", "LS-INV-2025-0001", "LS-POL-2016-0003"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 5.3, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0015", "answer": "In version 5.0 of the Travel & Expense Policy (effective 1 July 2024), the premium economy rule is:\n* **>=8h flights for L5+/M3+** (Premium economy may be booked on international flights with a scheduled duration of 8 hours or more for employees at level L5 and above or at management level M3 and above) [9, 11].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2024-0003", "LS-POL-2017-0001", "LS-MEM-2024-0001", "LS-POL-2022-0005", "LS-POL-2026-0010", "LS-HBK-2026-0001", "LS-POL-2024-0008", "LS-POL-2016-0004"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 6.72, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0021", "answer": "In version 2.0 of the Change Management Policy (effective 1 June 2022), the value for freeze windows is:\n\n* **Diwali week + Dec 20–Jan 2** [7, 9] \n*(Note: This represents a change from version 1.0, where the freeze window value was \"none\".)* [7, 9]", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2022-0001", "LS-POL-2025-0001", "LS-POL-2022-0006", "LS-SOP-2025-0002", "LS-POL-2018-0001", "LS-POL-2022-0012"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 5.02, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0025", "answer": "In version 3.0 of the Travel & Expense Policy (effective 1 April 2019), the stated value for the international hotel cap is USD 160 per night [2].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2019-0002", "LS-POL-2022-0003", "LS-POL-2016-0004", "LS-POL-2025-0003", "LS-HBK-2026-0001", "LS-POL-2018-0003", "LS-POL-2019-0007"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 6.85, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0036", "answer": "In version 1.0 of the Vulnerability Management Policy (effective 1 July 2019), the remediation deadline for medium severity findings (medium fix days) is 120 days [8, 10]. \n\n*(Note: Version 2.0 of the policy updated this value from 120 days to 90 days [8].)*", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2019-0012", "LS-POL-2023-0009", "LS-POL-2026-0013", "LS-POL-2019-0011", "LS-POL-2019-0004", "LS-POL-2019-0007"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 7.54, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0081", "answer": "Based on version 5.0 of the Travel and Expense Policy (effective 1 July 2024), the international hotel cap in Singapore is **SGD 280** per night [5, 9].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2024-0003", "LS-MEM-2024-0001", "LS-POL-2026-0010", "LS-POL-2024-0008", "LS-POL-2017-0001"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 9.56, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0082", "answer": "In version 2.0 of the Data Retention Policy (effective 1 April 2024), the stated value for security log archive is **1 year** [6, 7].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2024-0013", "LS-POL-2019-0010", "LS-HBK-2026-0001", "LS-POL-2026-0012", "LS-POL-2024-0005", "LS-POL-2024-0009"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 6.21, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
