{"qid": "Q0910", "answer": "Based on the provided sources:\n\n* **Incident INC-2025-0118** (lo-ingest-api degradation) blamed **Kubernetes** as the contributing technology [1].\n* **Project Ekam** (Statement of Work LS-SOW-2025-0008) is a current project (term: 4 December 2025 to 2 August 2026) where the Lumenstack project manager is **Sai Varma** [5]. However, the location/base for Sai Varma is not stated in the sources. \n* Alternatively, if looking at projects managed by personnel whose resumes mention Kubernetes: Chiranjeevi Hegde lists \"Kubernetes\" as a technical skill [3] and is the project manager for Project Agni [8]. Chiranjeevi Hegde is based in **Pune** [3]. \n\nAside from Chiranjeevi Hegde's resume, the sources do not specify the work location of Project Ekam's project manager (Sai Varma).", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-PMR-2025-0007", "LS-CV-2026-0117", "LS-CV-2026-0056", "LS-CV-2026-0111", "LS-SOW-2025-0008", "LS-POL-2025-0001", "LS-PMR-2025-0009", "LS-SOW-2025-0006"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 46.31, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0911", "answer": "Based on the provided sources:\n\n1. **Incident INC-2025-0093:** The contributing technology blamed for the outage is **ClickHouse** [1].\n2. **Current Project using ClickHouse:** Project Agni (IAC data warehouse build) uses ClickHouse (data warehouse build) [8], and Chiranjeevi Hegde is the current project manager for Project Agni [8]. \n3. **Project Manager's Location:** Chiranjeevi Hegde is based in **Pune** [3].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-PMR-2025-0005", "LS-CV-2026-0117", "LS-CV-2026-0056", "LS-CV-2026-0111", "LS-SOW-2025-0008", "LS-POL-2025-0001", "LS-PMR-2025-0009", "LS-SOW-2025-0006"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 39.44, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0912", "answer": "Based on the provided documents and graph facts:\n\n1. **Identify the technology blamed in incident INC-2025-0080:** \n   According to the postmortem for INC-2025-0080, the contributing technology / root cause is **PostgreSQL** [1].\n\n2. **Identify the current project that uses PostgreSQL:**\n   According to Naresh Shetty's resume, he is currently at Lumenstack Technologies (Oct 2024 – Present) [2] and his professional experience includes: *\"Built idempotent write paths and an outbox pattern for event publication to PostgreSQL\"* [2]. His key project listed is **Project Raptor** (Oct 2024 – Mar 2025) [2]. \n   *(Note: Chiranjeevi Hegde's projects Project Agni [7], Project Firefly, Project Cascade, and Project Pavan [3], as well as Ritu Nallapati's Project Saptagiri [4], do not list PostgreSQL as their technology, whereas Naresh Shetty's current role and Project Raptor directly involve PostgreSQL).*\n\n3. **Determine the project manager's location:**\n   Naresh Shetty's current location is **Bengaluru** [2].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-PMR-2025-0003", "LS-CV-2026-0117", "LS-CV-2026-0056", "LS-CV-2026-0111", "LS-SOW-2025-0008", "LS-POL-2025-0001", "LS-SOW-2025-0006", "LS-PMR-2025-0009"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 126.05, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q0914", "answer": "Based on the provided documents:\n\n1. **Incident INC-2024-0034** (`pl-backup-controller` partial outage) blames **OpenSearch** as the root cause (OpenSearch capacity exhausted under peak load) [2].\n2. **Project Cascade** (Mar 2024 – May 2025) used the project manager role [3], but it is in the past. \n3. Reviewing current projects from the sources:\n   - Chiranjeevi Hegde's current project is **Project Firefly** (Jun 2025 – Present) as a Workstream Lead [3].\n   - Other current projects listed across sources include Project Raptor (Naresh Shetty) [1], Project Saptagiri (Ritu Nallapati) [5], and Project Hawk (Sai Priya Chintalapudi) [8], none of which list a project manager or explicitly use OpenSearch.\n\nThe sources do not contain information identifying a project manager for a current project that uses OpenSearch. Therefore, the result is incomplete based on the provided facts and sources.", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-CV-2026-0117", "LS-PMR-2024-0004", "LS-CV-2026-0056", "LS-PMR-2026-0001", "LS-CV-2026-0111", "LS-PMR-2025-0009", "LS-MIN-2023-0006", "LS-CV-2026-0072"], "route": "vanilla", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 31.41, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
